# Betor, Kin to All: "At the beginning of your end step, if creatures you control have total toughness 10 or greater, draw a
# card. ..." is an intervening "if" (CR 603.4), and its ruling says that below 10 as the end step starts the ability doesn't
# trigger at all. Betor alone has toughness 7: nothing goes on the stack at the end step and no card is drawn.

